MUSIC QUERY RULE
Run IN ORDER. Stop at first match.

STEP A — FANDOM ANTHEM CHECK: search whether fans adopted a non-official song as the unofficial theme for this exact character/moment/film (TikTok edit captions, fancams, Know Your Meme). Confirm dominance: multiple independent high-view edits use the SAME song for the SAME scene. If yes → music_query = that track, is_fan_anthem = true.

STEP B — OFFICIAL OST CHECK: does [MOVIE/SERIES] have a recognizable official OST/instrumental matching the mood? If yes → music_query = that track, is_fan_anthem = false.

STEP C — GENERATE: music_query = null, is_fan_anthem = false, rely on music_prompt.

